    "Defect Discovery vs. Resolution Burnout Trend": "এই KPI টি a longitudinal timeline comparing incoming defect discovery trajectory against resolution burndown across the active time window.\\n\\nএটি তথ্য প্রদান করে যা tracks cumulative and daily counts of discovered vs. closed bugs across the selected time range window.\\n\\nএর কৌশলগত তাৎপর্য হলো that it confirms software convergence. A release is ready when the resolution curve outpaces discovery and approaches zero.",
